 port (based on the IP of the drone). My different instances of mavsdk_server were listening on those different ports, and voila!", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3324264719/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3324408081", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2659#issuecomment-3324408081", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2659", "id": 3324408081, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7GJnER", "user": {"login": "endofpen", "id": 101623754, "node_id": "U_kgDOBg6nyg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101623754?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/endofpen", "html_url": "https://github.com/endofpen", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/endofpen/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/endofpen/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/endofpen/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/endofpen/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/endofpen/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/endofpen/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/endofpen/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/endofpen/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/endofpen/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:02:02Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-23T15:02:02Z", "body": "Thanks for your quick answer. Maybe that proxy is a solution for me. Can you recommend a lib to archive that?\nOr is it possible to configure the drones, so they send there mavlink data to the right port of the mavsdk_server?\n\nCurrently i am starting a px4 sitl on my wsl ubuntu like this: HEADLESS=1 make px4_sitl gz_x500\n\nI configured the px4-rc.mavlink file, so the mavsdk_server running on my windows 11 host can connect:\n\n```\n# GCS link\nmavlink start -x -u $udp_gcs_port_local -r 4000000 -f -t 172.20.112.1\n```\n\nStarting the mavsdk_server like this:\n`.\\mavsdk_server_win_x86.exe udpout://172.20.116.189:14580 -p 50041`\n\nIs that the right way ? ", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3324408081/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/3324629400", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2659#issuecomment-3324629400", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2659", "id": 3324629400, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7GKdGY", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "